Workflow:

1. Warehouse PRO user logs into the app and is required to select the Vendor ID Range before continuing with a Stock Addition.  Message should appear saying that they cannot do a Stock Addition without going to Settings and selecting a Vendor ID Range.

2. The user must first take a photo of the BOL form by either accessing their camera or selecting a list of existing images from their gallery.

3. They can either confirm, delete, or add more photos.  Otherwise they can hit continue to move to the next step.
**Photos need to be uploaded to AttachToo with the Voucher as a sub-document.  Document Type needs to be discussed.

4. The User will be able to search for the Vendor by either entering Name, Name ID, City, or Phone Number and select from an available list of Vendors.

5. The User can confirm Vendor Selection and hit continue to move on to Item Selection
**Remit To should be based on what is selected for the Vendor automatically but should not be visible to the user

6. User should be able to search for an item using the barcode scanner or by entering in item information to pull a list of relevant items

7. Once an item is selected should take user to a new page that will allow them to enter the qty and view the UOM
**If the item requires a lot number or specification fields like LOT# those should appear below the quantity and be required to enter before continuing.

8. Once User completes the first item they should be taken to an item information page where they can choose to: delete or edit an item they entered; add another item to the stock addition; or continue to the next screen.

9. If required* User will need to enter Transaction Fields which are customizable based on setup in AGRIS and configuration setup in Action List

10. User will be required to enter the BOL # and can choose to enter Voucher Description and Remarks

10. User will be taken to a Summary page where they can review the following: Vendor Information; BOL Photos; Item Information; BOL #; Voucher Description; and Remarks
**User will need to scroll down to the bottom of the page in order to Submit the voucher 

11. Once Submitted, User will view a confirmation and Voucher # from AGRIS


ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA:
1. Warehouse Pro users only can access Stock Addition feature
2. User can access a list of vendor names to add Stock Addition information
3. The user can look up the list of items based on Location ID and/or Barcode Scan
4. Barcode scan can return information about the item
5. The user can enter additional item information
6. The user can review the final Voucher information and go back to make changes if need be
7. Once the voucher is submitted in App, it needs to return to Agris as a copy and paste and generate an automatic voucher number


